      "monday-002|no_unsupported_causality": "The PARTIAL band reads, in full: 'Unsupported cause only as explicit hypothesis.' The three responses offer the Globex support-fix-unblocks-procurement linkage as an explicitly labelled hypothesis. The rubric text therefore leans toward the blind judge's PARTIAL; the original judge read the hedged phrasing as a data-consistent observation rather than a cause claim.",
